  "slug": "easy-raspberry-lemonade",
  "name": "Easy Raspberry Lemonade",
  "recipe_type": "soup",
  "brief_description": "We came up with this recipe for my brother's wedding reception. We wanted to serve something that was easy and quick to fix, yet good at the same time. After a few tries, we ended up with this recipe...and a lot of compliments.",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "In a large punch bowl, combine raspberry lemonade concentrate, water and lime juice. Stir in lemon-lime soda and crushed ice. Garnish each glass with a fresh raspberry and a mint leaf."
    }
  ],
